          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78645,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jusqu'à présent, nous avons appris à créer une boucle <code>while</code>, concentrons-nous maintenant sur la façon de les empêcher de boucler indéfiniment.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Creating the variable",
            "id": 78648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pour arrêter une boucle, nous commençons par créer une variable en dehors de la boucle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_going</code> suivi de <code>=</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pour arrêter une boucle, nous créons d'abord une variable en dehors de celle-ci. Donne à <code>keep_going</code> la valeur initiale <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_going</code> suivi de <code>=</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variable in the condition",
            "id": 78647,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nous utilisons la variable dans la condition pour décider si la boucle doit exécuter son bloc de code ou non. Par exemple, <code>keep_going == True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_going</code> suivi de <code>==</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La boucle vérifie la variable pour décider si elle doit s'exécuter. Compare <code>keep_going</code> à gauche à <code>True</code> à droite.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_going</code> suivi de <code>==</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Updating the variable",
            "id": 78670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>À l'intérieur du bloc de code, nous arrêtons la boucle en définissant <code>keep_going</code> sur <code>False</code> afin que la condition renvoie <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de rentrer <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Stopping the loop",
            "id": 78644,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La boucle exécute l'intégralité de son bloc de code parce que <code>keep_going</code> est <code>True</code> au début, mais ne s'exécute pas à nouveau si nous définissons <code>keep_going</code> à <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;one more time&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"one more time\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Creating the variable",
            "id": 78643,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comment savons-nous que cette boucle s'exécute et ne cesse jamais de répéter son bloc de code ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"load_data = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading data..&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il n'y a pas de variable dans la condition</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cette boucle ne s'exécutera pas car la condition est <code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il n'y a pas de variable dans la condition.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Suppose que tu supprimes la première ligne. Que se passerait-il dans la boucle ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"load_data = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading data..&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loading data..\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elle se répéterait quand même indéfiniment, car sa condition est <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elle échouerait, car <code>load_data</code> ne serait plus défini.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elle ne s'exécuterait qu'une fois, car aucune variable ne serait mise à jour.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elle se répéterait quand même indéfiniment, car sa condition est <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Variable in the condition",
            "id": 78642,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comment savons-nous que la boucle <code>while</code> saute l'instruction <code>print</code> ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_loading = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_loading == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parce que <code>is_loading</code> est <code>False</code>, donc la condition n'est pas remplie</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parce que <code>is_loading</code> est <code>True</code>, donc la condition est remplie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parce que <code>is_loading</code> est <code>False</code>, donc la condition n'est pas remplie.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Suppose que la première ligne assigne plutôt <code>True</code>. Que ferait le code modifié ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_loading = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_loading == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il afficherait <code>Loading Game</code> sans arrêt, car <code>is_loading</code> ne change jamais.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il afficherait <code>Loading Game</code> une fois, puis s'arrêterait.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il ignorerait toujours l'appel à <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il afficherait <code>Loading Game</code> sans arrêt, car <code>is_loading</code> ne change jamais.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Updating the variable",
            "id": 78641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comment savons-nous que cette boucle s'arrête ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La variable <code>keep_going</code> est mise à jour à <code>False</code> à l'intérieur du bloc de code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nous ne savons pas si la boucle s'arrête</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La variable <code>keep_going</code> est mise à jour à <code>False</code> à l'intérieur du bloc de code.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La boucle ci-dessous affiche <code>Just keep swimming</code> une seule fois.</p><p>Quelle est la valeur de <code>keep_going</code> lorsque la condition <code>while</code> est vérifiée pour la deuxième fois ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code>, donc la boucle s'arrête là.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code>, car la première ligne l'a mise à <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il n'y a pas de deuxième vérification, car la boucle s'arrête dès que <code>keep_going</code> change.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>False</code>, donc la boucle s'arrête là.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Stopping the loop",
            "id": 78640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que montre ce code dans la console ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_playing == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Now Playing: Dolce Vita&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Now Playing: Dolce Vita\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Now Playing: Dolce Vita</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ce code n'affiche rien dans la console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Now Playing: Dolce Vita</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combien de fois le message s'affiche-t-il et qu'est-ce qui empêche la boucle de s'exécuter à nouveau ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_playing == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Now Playing: Dolce Vita&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Now Playing: Dolce Vita\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Une fois, car <code>keep_playing</code> passe à <code>False</code> après le premier affichage.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aucune fois, car <code>keep_playing = False</code> se trouve dans la boucle.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indéfiniment, car <code>keep_playing</code> commence à <code>True</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Une fois, car <code>keep_playing</code> passe à <code>False</code> après le premier affichage.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Creating the variable",
            "id": 78639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crée une variable pour la boucle <code>while</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_playing == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Now Playing: Ryan Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Now Playing: Ryan Paris\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_playing</code> suivi de <code>=</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crée la variable que la boucle <code>while</code> vérifie. Donne à <code>keep_playing</code> la valeur initiale <code>True</code> pour exécuter la boucle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_playing == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Now Playing: Ryan Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_playing = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Now Playing: Ryan Paris\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>keep_playing</code> suivi de <code>=</code> et enfin <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
